        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Holdstock, H. L. Mencken\n- Roles: novelist, author, journalist, satirist, cultural critic, scholar\n- Topics: fantasy literature, mythic fiction, American English\n\nFacts:\n- H. L. Mencken, born Henry Louis Mencken, lived from September 12, 1880 to January 29, 1956.\n- H. L. Mencken was an American journalist, satirist, cultural critic, and scholar of American English.\n- Robert Holdstock, born Robert Paul Holdstock, lived from 2 August 1948 to 29 November 2009.\n- Robert Holdstock was an English novelist and author best known for Celtic, Nordic, Gothic, and Pictish fantasy literature, mainly in the mythic fiction subgenre.",
